# PART A — UNDERSTAND MANIFOLD

MANIFOLD is a Nigerian automotive commerce ecosystem with the following major components:

1. MANIFOLD WORLD — an interactive, game-first automotive environment built around an immersive 3D driving experience.
2. Vehicle Marketplace — a professional dealer-based vehicle marketplace.
3. Dealer Portal — vehicle inventory management, listings, dealer operations and enquiries.
4. Buyer Experience — vehicle discovery, comparisons, enquiries, inspections and concierge services.
5. Price Intelligence — automotive price analysis and vehicle valuation intelligence.
6. Market Intelligence — automotive market data ingestion, analysis, knowledge management and reporting.
7. Administrative Platform — dealer management, marketplace oversight, intelligence monitoring and business operations.

The game is an acquisition and engagement layer, not the entire product.

The larger commercial objective is to build an intelligent automotive commerce ecosystem powered by real inventory, verified data, intelligent search, AI-assisted decisions and operational automation.

