# PART B — CRITICAL MANIFOLD BUSINESS RULE

## Vehicle Title / Headline = MODEL

This is a non-negotiable business rule.

The Vehicle Headline/Title displayed across MANIFOLD is the actual vehicle Model.

Example:

- Make: Toyota
- Model: Camry
- Variant: XSE
- Year: 2022

The vehicle listing title must be:

**Toyota Camry**

It must NOT become:

- Luxury Redefined
- The Ultimate Driving Experience
- A Premium Sedan for Every Journey
- Discover Unmatched Comfort

These are marketing phrases, not vehicle model names.

AI-generated content must remain separate from the actual vehicle title.

The AI may generate:

- Vehicle description
- Short description
- Selling highlights
- SEO title
- SEO meta description
- Buyer-facing explanations

It must never overwrite or replace the actual Model or the listing's Vehicle Title.

Preserve this rule across database operations, dealer forms, vehicle cards, detail pages, search results and AI responses.

